# Node.js Backend

- Dung cau truc route -> controller -> service -> Prisma/repository.
- Route khong chua business logic.
- Moi body, params va query phai duoc validate o backend.
- Moi resource co ownership phai kiem tra authentication va authorization.
- Dung response format `{ data, meta, error }`.
- Error phai co error code on dinh, khong de frontend phan tich message tu do.
- Dung status code HTTP phu hop.
- Dung transaction cho thao tac nhieu bang.
- Khong tra password hash, refresh token hash hoac du lieu nhay cam.
- Hash password bang thu vien tin cay, khong tu viet thuat toan hash.
- Dung rate limit cho login, upload, comment va report.
- Kiem tra mime type, dung luong va quyen so huu file upload.
- Khong dung string concatenation cho SQL.
- Ghi log loi o server, khong tra stack trace trong production.
- Dung soft delete cho User, Recipe, Cooksnap va Comment.
